# Dependencies of the M17 interactive demonstration (app.py), kept SEPARATE from the research
# environment on purpose.
#
# `requirements.txt` and `requirements.lock.txt` record the environment that produced the
# experimental results. Adding a visualisation framework to that record would mean the environment
# named in the paper is not the environment the paper's numbers came from. The demonstration is a
# viewer over frozen artefacts; it can have its own dependencies without touching theirs.
#
# Installed with the research environment pinned as a hard constraint:
#
#     .venv/Scripts/python.exe -m pip freeze > constraints.txt
#     .venv/Scripts/python.exe -m pip install -r requirements-demo.in --constraint constraints.txt
#
# The constraint means pip may only ADD packages, never upgrade one the research pipeline depends
# on. Verified on 2026-08-27: no pre-existing package changed version, and
# `scripts/check_environment.py` still passes all 10 checks.

streamlit==1.62.0
